            <h3>Getting Started</h3>
            <p>Log in with your staff account. Your dashboard shows the tasks available for your role.</p>
            <h3>Managers</h3>
            <p>Manage staff accounts, search patients and dentists, view appointments, check analytics, and generate reports.</p>
            <h3>Receptionists</h3>
            <p>Register and manage patients, book and manage appointments, and calculate and print bills.</p>
